---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="work-custom-real-estate-crm">
<main>
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 72px 0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA">
  <a href="/" data-route="home" style="color:#A1A1AA">Home</a> <span style="color:#3F3F46">/</span> <a href="/work" data-route="work" style="color:#A1A1AA">Work</a> <span style="color:#3F3F46">/</span> <span style="color:#F8FAFC">Custom Real Estate CRM</span>
</nav>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 72px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:38px">
  <div data-row="" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:48px">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:780px">
      <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Case study · CRM &amp; Custom Systems</div>
      <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">Custom Real Estate CRM</h1>
      <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty">A system shaped around one brokerage’s real workflow: contacts, properties, opportunities and follow-ups in a single place. In development.</p>
      <div style="align-self:flex-start;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Custom Product Design / In Development</div>
    </div>
    <dl style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin:0;min-width:250px;font-size:13.5px">
      <div><dt style="color:#A1A1AA;margin-bottom:5px">Category</dt><dd style="margin:0">CRM &amp; Custom Systems</dd></div>
      <div><dt style="color:#A1A1AA;margin-bottom:5px">Services</dt><dd style="margin:0;line-height:1.7">Product Strategy<br>CRM Architecture<br>Workflow Design<br>Interface Design<br>Responsive System Design<br>Custom Function Planning</dd></div>
      <div><dt style="color:#A1A1AA;margin-bottom:5px">Status</dt><dd style="margin:0">Custom Product Design / In Development</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <div data-art-id="custom-real-estate-crm-case-study" data-art="" data-art-slot="" style="position:relative;height:520px;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><Artwork id="custom-real-estate-crm-case-study" />
  <div data-art-note="" style="padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:560px">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CUSTOM REAL ESTATE CRM CASE STUDY</span>
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">21:9 desktop · 4:5 tablet · 1:1 mobile · focal convergence point off-centre · separate mobile render required</span>
  </div></div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.25fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div data-sticky="" style="position:sticky;top:110px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Overview</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Designed around the work, not the software.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">A luxury property sale is a long, many-sided conversation. Advisors juggle buyers, sellers, listings, developers, appointments, follow-ups, documents, referrals and transactions across cycles that run for months.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">This project scopes a CRM built for that reality rather than around it. It is currently in development.</p>
    <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">What made it difficult</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Off-the-shelf platforms ask the business to bend. Fields get repurposed, workflows get approximated, and eventually the real process moves back into spreadsheets and messages.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The work began by describing precisely how this advisor manages relationships, live opportunities, property information and next actions — then designing to that description.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">How we worked</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The workflow was mapped before a single screen was drawn. From it came a set of connected modules covering:</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:8px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Clients and leads</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Buyer requirements</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Sellers</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Properties</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Developers and projects</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Active opportunities</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Follow-ups</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Appointments and calendar activity</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Documents</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Referral-fee tracking</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Pipeline stages</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Notes and activity history</span></div></div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B">These modules belong to the approved scope of this project. They are not automatically included in every CRM Create Studio builds — each system is scoped around the functions that business actually requires.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The solution</div>
    <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">One place where the day makes sense.</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">Property, client and opportunity information live in one interface, so the advisor stops reconstructing context from four different tools.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:6px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Clear daily priorities</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Faster access to relevant information</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Consistent follow-up</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Better organization</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Connected records</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Reduced dependence on disconnected tools</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Responsive access across devices</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div data-art-id="custom-real-estate-crm-case-study-detail" data-art="" data-art-slot="" style="position:relative;height:560px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><Artwork id="custom-real-estate-crm-case-study-detail" />
  <div data-art-note="" style="padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:560px">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CUSTOM REAL ESTATE CRM CASE STUDY — DETAIL</span>
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">Secondary crop of the same asset · 4:5 desktop · 3:2 mobile · no text overlap</span>
  </div></div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Project status</div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:22px">
    <div style="padding:38px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(37,99,255,.08),rgba(139,92,246,.05)),#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.3)">
      <h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600">Project status</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#F8FAFC">The approved scope shows what it looks like when a system is shaped around a specific business rather than the other way round. Development is ongoing.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:38px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Selected system areas</h3>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Daily priority view</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Client and lead records</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Property and project records</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Opportunity pipeline</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Calendar and follow-ups</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Reporting overview</span></div></div>
      <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B">Interface captures are added as the system reaches a shareable state.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 80px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px" data-cols="">
  <a href="/work/joan-leonardo" data-route="work-joan-leonardo" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:32px 36px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA">← Previous project</span>
    <span style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Joan Leonardo</span>
  </a>
  <a href="/work/create-studio" data-route="work-create-studio" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:32px 36px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:right;align-items:flex-end">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA">Next project →</span>
    <span style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Create Studio</span>
  </a>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="padding:0 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto">
  <div style="padding:80px 60px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:22px">
    <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.08;max-width:720px">Still running the business across four different tools?</h2>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:17px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px">Every CRM and custom system is individually scoped and custom quoted. Describe how your team works today and we will review the requirements before preparing a proposal.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:4px"><a href="/contact?service=crm-custom-systems" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Request a Custom Quote</a><a href="/work" data-route="work" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Explore Our Work</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-slogan="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding:104px 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;text-align:center">
  <p style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05;text-wrap:pretty">We Create. <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">You Grow.</span></p>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
